{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0053_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0a3c8101c7a131878613f7d3943c7e0a6efaba460ffa7a558ec743c9522e45ed", "ja": "（ひな祭りのイベントが終わり、みんなで\nちょっとした打ち上げをすることになった）", "zh": "（女儿节的活动结束了，\n大家决定举办小型的庆功宴。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0053_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "dc001f93b3df5e5d08f01afb25a9254a17ab272eeff84f5c39418eebdc74d553", "ja": "お待たせ、{$P$}。悪かったな、\nメイク落とすのにちょっと時間がかかっちまってさ。", "zh": "久等啦，{$P$}。\n抱歉，花了点时间卸妆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0053_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5dde87bbf230e4da20f50fade6888b32142ae75680a2a565df6ec79692bb3055", "ja": "ああ、お疲れさま。\n……うん、完全にいつものジュリアだな！", "zh": "不会，辛苦了。\n……嗯，完全变回平时的茱莉亚了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0053_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "76a7d49391dd2c6b85ac022a37cb7c4646d9ca9c43660cd0d27fd5cff2598038", "ja": "ははっ、なんだよそれ。\nあたしはいつも、あたしだろ？", "zh": "哈哈，你在说什么啊？\n我一直都是我啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0053_1004_p", "source_sha256": "e53241cb79c5a4fb8eb9893d60b754ca7f002bff2353363ba63d5a14d70a5881", "ja": "まあそうなんだけど。お雛様のジュリアが\n新鮮だったから、ちょっともったいないなって……。", "zh": "是这么说没错，但看到茱莉亚扮成皇后人偶实在很新鲜，\n就这样卸掉还挺可惜的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0053_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "be026dbd2394d466bbc2436221e58cd8bcc7601f70cc4aa39461514e8b2cce89", "ja": "おいおい、あんたまでそんなこと言うのかよ？\nまぁ、会場も盛り上がってたみたいだけど……。", "zh": "喂喂喂，怎么连你都说这种话？\n不过，活动现场的气氛确实是很热烈啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0053_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "36cd34d9dc1e7306e776ffd75cfe1744aa32d371dab7547bfa598a0ab2d3dbdf", "ja": "お行儀よく座ってるお姫様なんて、\nあたしのガラじゃないと思うんだけどな。", "zh": "但我真的觉得自己很不适合\n扮演乖乖坐着的皇后啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0053_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a2c3c77236e1cd4ba8b2c41816dfa3946db160c075b67e253a6d1a4bc796c7e7", "ja": "そんな事ないよ。\nおしとやかなジュリアも、可愛かったと思う。", "zh": "怎么会呢？\n我觉得端庄贤淑的茱莉亚也很可爱喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0053_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "9f1c437418fe5897815114c32bf7359226c0b69a61fce72eecb9a50246001e25", "ja": "なっ……き、急に何言い出すんだよ！　ったく……\nあたしが相手だからって、適当なコト言うなっての。", "zh": "什……你、你怎么突然这么说啊！？真是的……\n不要看对象是我，就随便敷衍好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0053_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a56aae20ff2aef6aa609ad8a20beb08223f9ae3bb7f3de1969c781469d71019a", "ja": "適当じゃないよ。ジュリアはいつもジュリア、だろ？\nだからお雛様のジュリアも、ジュリアって事だ！", "zh": "我才没有敷衍。茱莉亚，你就是你，不是吗？\n所以茱莉亚就算扮成皇后也还是茱莉亚啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0053_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "04e7d9bf588a240e53783ac681dc26e0f9af774a46aff11e9a9b96f99c928eab", "ja": "うぅ……！　{$P$}こそ、\nいつもどおり、{$P$}だな！", "zh": "呜呜……！{$P$}，你才是吧，\n跟平时的{$P$}没两样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0053_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "efb5ad9470f7350b8fd3def1fb1bfca1beff071eaf314de69364773ed76ca567", "ja": "まあ……正直、ちょっと楽しかったけどさ。\n……ほ、ほら！　早く行こう！", "zh": "不过……老实说，我是挺高兴的啦。\n……好、好啦！快点走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0053_1012_p", "source_sha256": "49b8893651e0f9adcbae7f5f19746f9db1432bdf3d402931eba59461657ece71", "ja": "そうだな。\nお雛様がいなきゃ、宴が始まらないもんな。", "zh": "你说得对。\n皇后都还没到，宴会要怎么开始呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0053_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "4db35a05f87aa5f38a97bd68e5f8ed456fb75a020c2a288186155bace2535b91", "ja": "あたしがお雛様なら、あんたは、おだ……\nい、いや、何でもない！　行くぞ！", "zh": "如果我是皇后，那你就是，天皇……\n没、没事，我什么都没说！走啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
